bibit-agenthub-plugin (0.3.1) resolute-porting; urgency=medium

  * Unified release for the Power market page (folds in the intermediate
    0.3.2-0.3.5 work).
  * The page owns its scroll container: it is sized against the viewport and
    measured against the box the host hands the plugin, so every card and the
    bottom-pinned pagination are reachable.
  * The card description is a fixed 5-line inner scroller with no horizontal
    bar; the full description stays in the details dialog.
  * Every plugin scroller (page, description, both tag rows, dialog body) hides
    the native bar and draws its own indicator: invisible at rest, visible with
    the position while scrolling, faded out a second later. The platform bar
    cannot be styled from a plugin page - see docs 7.2.1 for the measurements.
  * Power names never wrap: the title box is one line high on every card and
    the font size is fitted between 19px and 13px, so the card rows line up.

